<title>USA: American Century in talks with J.P. Morgan.</title>
<headline>American Century in talks with J.P. Morgan.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mutual fund company American Century Cos. said on Monday it was discussing the sale of a minority stake to J.P. Morgan &amp; Co Inc.</p>
<p>American Century spokesman Gunnar Hughes declined to offer details about the talks except to say that no agreement had yet been reached and that any deal would be for a minority stake in American Century.</p>
</text>
